Claude Chat

This app includes phone-control code adapted from buddy-android.

  Project:   buddy-android
  Upstream:  https://github.com/ghorbelhamdi/buddy-android
  Copyright: ghorbelhamdi (upstream author; the upstream LICENSE file has no copyright line)
  License:   Apache License, Version 2.0. The full text is in buddy-LICENSE.txt in this folder.

Adapted files (package com.claudechat.phone):
  McpServer.java  from app/buddy/assistant/McpServer.java: local MCP server on 127.0.0.1:8765
  Tools.java      from app/buddy/assistant/Tools.java: the phone tools (read_screen, tap, type_text, scroll, ...)
  PhoneService.java  from app/buddy/assistant/BuddyService.java: accessibility service that hosts the server

Written for Claude Chat, not copied: ConfirmActivity.java (approval dialog, in place of the upstream bubble),
PhoneControl.java (switch and token), and the resource files phone_access.xml and the phone_* / confirm_* strings.

Changes from upstream: no bubble overlay, chat hub, onboarding, Termux helper endpoints, attachment endpoint,
lock-screen handling or keyboard tracking. Approvals are a dialog, status is a toast and the control notice is a
plain notification. Each adapted Java file carries a header that says so.

This app also ships PRoot as two native files (lib/arm64-v8a/libproot.so and libproot-loader.so), unmodified
prebuilt binaries from green-green-avk/build-proot-android (packages/proot-android-aarch64.tar.gz, June 2023).

  Project:   PRoot (fork https://github.com/green-green-avk/proot, upstream https://github.com/proot-me/proot)
  License:   GNU General Public License, version 2. Talloc (linked in statically) is LGPL-3.0.
  Source:    https://github.com/green-green-avk/proot and https://github.com/green-green-avk/build-proot-android

The Ubuntu userland is not part of the APK: the app downloads ubuntu-base from cdimage.ubuntu.com on first use.
